<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49295" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῠ-ηλή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>part of a victim offered in burntsacrifice</i>, usu. in
			pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δ᾽ ἐν πυρὶ βάλλε θυηλάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.220
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philoch.
				172
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.566a
			</span></i>: generally, <i>sacrifice</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνευ θυηλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1520
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυηλαὶ ἀναίμακτοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.324.3
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσίαι καὶ θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.59
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυηλὴ Ἄρεος</span>
			<i>an offering</i> to Ares, i.e. the blood of the slain, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1423
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτης θυηλαί</span> cj. <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύελλαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				819
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυάλημα,
		θύλημα</span>.</div>
